        <p>WIDOW WELCH'S PILLS FOE FEMALE COMPLAINTS MRS. SHITITERS. Grand-daughter to the Widow Welch. continues to prepare this celebrated Medicine from the only original and genuine Family Recipe. Its justcelebrity for all Female Complaints has obtained far it a most extensive and increasing demand Purchasers should the-efore attend to the following CAUTION.—To be careful that what they purchase is prepared by Mrs. Smithers. who is the only person in possesalon of the ORIGINAL RECIPE, The genuine are wrapped in Blue Paper, and signed on the Outside label by Mrs. Smithers, and the names of the ole Wholesale Agents, "W. REWARDS mt SON, 1157, Queen Victoria-street," formerly e 67, St. Paul's, London, are engraved on the Governmen Stamp, Sold in boxes at 2s. 9d. each, by most Chemists.</p>
