      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-07-08_WidnesExaminer_art0009" n="art0009">
        <p>WORSLEY'S BIG SALE</p>
        <p>ENORMOUS SACRI FICE IN FURNITURE, CARPETS.</p>
        <p>The Receivers and Liquidators appointed to wind up WORSLEY'S. LIKITED, have given most positive instruc- tions to clear out the whole of the Stock at any price. NO REASONABLE OFFER WILL BE REFUSED. You are cordially invited to Call and Inspect the Stock contained in the Eight Largest Showrooms In the North of England. Every article, without exception, Is marked in plain figures You will not be asked to buy. You may walk round and view the goods by yourselves, sad if any strike your fancy there will be a salesman near who will be pleased to take your Instructions and see them properly carried out.</p>
        <p>Thereis a large and cool REFRESHMENT ROOM, where visitors(whether purchasers or not) are supplied with light refreshments gratis. Waitresses In attendance.</p>
        <p>We append a few of the Leading Lines, marked consider- ably below original cost prices,viz : HALL STANDS. in oak, walnut, and bamboo, at 255, 30s, 38s, 488, 558, 638, 758, 935, and 100 s. HALL CHAIRS, in oak, w limit. and mahvany, at 3s lid 10s 6d, 12s 6d, 158, 178 61, 21s, and 25s each. LIBRARY SUITBS at £4 15s, 6gs, 7gs, Bgs, 9,10 gs, and upwards to IBgs. BOOKCASES from 29s upwards. WRITING TABLES and DESKS, from £3 108, upwards, in great variety.</p>
        <p>DINING-ROOM SUITES in Oak, Walnut, Mahogany, &amp;c, at 3gs, £3 15s, 4gs, sgs, £5 10s, 60, £6 15s, 7gs, £7 las 6d, Sgs, Slgs, 9ge, 9igs, 10gs, 10igs, Ilgs, 12gs, 13gs, 14gs, and upwards to 50gs, covered In variety of Moroceos, French Roans, Pegamoids, American Cloth, Velvets (embossed and plain), Frelzes, gapestrles, Po. SIDEBOARDS In Oak at £5 10s to 30gs, Pollard Oak, 18gs, Carved Oak lags, 18gs, and £?,B, Fumigated Oak at £l9, £2O, £23 10s, and £25.</p>
        <p>ES 10s SIDIMARDS in Walnut at 423. £4 10a £8 IGs. lOgs, 14gs, 15ga, 18gs, £l9 10s, £2l, En, £24, £2 ,5, £26, and £29</p>
