        <p>DINING TABLES in Oaks, Walnut, Mahogany, &amp;e, sizes sft, 6ft, 7ft, Bft, 10ft, and 141 t, from 28s upwards. OVI3IIMANTBES, ea 14s 114, 178 94, 22s 64, 27s 63, 32s 64, 37s 64, 445, 60s,- 555, 60s, 675, 64, 755, 84s, 90s, 100 s, and up- wards t•.) 10gs. -</p>
        <p>DRAWING-ROOM SUITES in Chippeniale, Mahogany, Walnut. Ebony, Rosewoods, Inlaids, Ste, covered in choice Genoa Velvets, rich Silks, Embossed Velvet Silk, and other Tapestries, Brocateils, to, at £4 17s 6d, £5 10s, 6gs, £6 16s. 7gs. £7 17s 6d, Sgs. £9, £9 10s, lOgs, Ell Iss, £l2 los, 3310, and upwards to £2B 105.</p>
        <p>DRAWING-ROOM CABINETS to match suites, in Walnut at 425, £3 10s, ags, and £l4 : Rosewood Inlaid at 6g., £6 16s, £7 18s 6d, 9gs, £1 178 6d, £l4, and an exceptionally fine Dis- play Cabinet, 50gs ; Mahogtuy at 35s to 19p, and Chippen dale Cabinets, of which we nold an exceptionally fine assort_ ment, at lOgs, £l2 10s, 16gs, 16gs, 17gs, lags, £l9. £2l, £24 £26, 27gs, 30s, and £3B 10s.</p>
        <p>DRAWING-ROOM TABUS, Card Tables, Wine Tables, etc., from 9s 6d to Bgs. Hundreds to select from, DRAWING-ROOM OVERMANTELS, en suite from 17s lid upwards to 12gs.</p>
        <p>wood, pollard BEDROOM Sill CRS in that rare and pretty rak at £3B. £45. and £55 • in other oaks at 15gs, 18gs, and 22ge ; ash and pollard cak, 216 • Sheraton Suite. 6ft., £7s' Chippendale Mahogany Suites, '£4s £65, and £BO ; Rosewood Inlaid Suites, £36 ; Walnut Suites, Sgs, jigs, 14gs, 18g. 26gs, and 30gs ; Satin Walnut Staes, £8 17 6d, 9gs li3g;i, llgs, 12gs 14gs, 16gs, 18gs, ngs, 28gs, and 30gs ;Painted Suites, £2 1756c1, 4gs. 26 15s. The Pantheon Suite is now being cleared at £8 17s 6d ; usual price 11gs. BEDSTEADS, Black and Brass, full size, 6s 11d. Is 11d, 8s 11d. 10s, 12e 6d, 15.6(1, 21s, 255, 27s 6d, 30s, 38s, 425, 50e, and up to sgs, All Brass from 455, to 28 guineas. Spring, Wool, and Hair Mattresses.</p>
        <p>ODDS AND ENDS,-200 Toilet sets from Is lid. Toilet Glasses from 2s Ild, Kitchen Dressers, all enclosed and solid tops. from 255. Couches from 14s 9d, Sofas, in hair- seating, 37s 6d. Chairs, to match, from 4a 11d.</p>
        <p>CARPETS.—Axminster. 2s 93, 3s 11d, 4s 11d, and 5s lid ; Brussels, is 93, is 11d, 2e 43, 2s 64. Is 93. and 2s lid ; Tapestry, 110. is 33, is 64, Is 94. is lid, and 2s 3cl ; other carpets from 40 per yard; Rugs, Mate, Sce ; Linoleume, Did, is 3d, is 64, is 94, is 11d, and 2s 3d ; Vas very best inlaid 3s 11d, fitted free.</p>
