        <head>WARRINGTON TOWN COUNCIL.</head>
        <p>WARRINGTON TOWN COUNCIL.</p>
        <p>Meeting of this Council was held in the Council Chamber at the Town Hall, Warrington, on Tuesday evening. The tidayor (Alderman Wright) presided, and there were also present Alderman Fairclough (deputy Mayor), Aldermen Harrison, Sutton,Blacithurit.Roberts, BUtchinson. Bolton, Councillors Shaw Green, nerpoint, Illurapton. Smethurst, Bmnett, Evans, Ellison, Darman, Burton, Crosfield, Furness, Tinnion, Peacock, F. R. B.oberts, Grace, Jolley, Rogers, Woods, Shillcock, klnson, Monks, Heaton, John Rtherts,Lee, Cannell.with Mr. J. Lynn Whittle (town clerk), Mr. Stanley Wilson (deputy town clerk), Mr. Fairhurst (borough trasurer), Mr. T. Longdin (borough surveyor), Mr. Haddock (gas engineer).</p>
