        <p>There i 3 only on, "First" in a race, and it is ashnow- ledged witheut doubt that GWILYNI EVANS' QUININE BITTERS, The Vegetable Tonic, is The Best Remedy of the Age for Weakness, Nervousness, Indigestion, Loss of Appetite, Impure Blood, Chest Affections, Low Spirits, nd Influenza. This remedy of world-wide fame strengthens that part of the system which is weakest or nas been weakensd by disease,and therefore more liable to colds and their attendant ailments ; it purifies the blood arid stimulates the circulation, assists and pro- motes digestion, and improves the appetite. It braces the nerves and fortifies the muscles, rouses the sluggish liver, and thus enlivens the spirits ; it removes all im- purities and obstructions from the humsn body, and gives tone to the whole system. Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters is purely vegetable, for the fermula includes the Tonic properties of Sarsaparilla, Saffron, Gewian, Bur- dock, Lavender, and Dandelion, in addition to Quinine, and is suitable to all „ages, from the. infant</p>
        <p>to the adult, and confidently recommended to those Who have to devote themselves to study and brain work, to all who work long hours in Close rooms, to those who breatho impure air, and all who have to stand exposure of the weather. People that suffer from brain tag and sleeplessness, who feel" out of sorts "and "run down" find rapid and permanent relief from the use of Grwilym Evans' Qr_rinine Bitters. The occupations of some men keep their whole faculties continually at their furthest stretch, and life is all hurry and worry. Little wonder is it that this extreme tension leads to an unusual wear and tear of the nerves and that these hard-worked toilers</p>
        <p>require an extra su-ste—nance for body and brain. Now, Ciwilyrn Evans' Quinine Bitters feeds both, and men are wise if they look ahead and preserve their strength by , taking this infallible feeder to all vital powers. There are five fixed facts about this renowned preparation-1-4, used by medical profession; 2nd a purely vegetable corn- pound :3rd, absolutely free from mercury ; 4th, tested for a quarter of a century ; sth, The Best Tonic. There are many medicinal tonics offered to the Fublic,but they may be classified un4er two heads :—The Best and The Rest. GWILYM EVANS' QUININE BITTERS IS TUE BEST. Caution, beware of imitations. See that you get Gwilyna Evans' 'Quinine Bitters, with the xi, me Gwilym Evans "on label, stamp, and bottle. Sold everywhere in bottles at 2e. 9J. and 0. 61.. or in cases containing threo 4e. 61. bottle 4 at 124. 61 per case. Should any difficulty be experienced in procuring it the Proprietors will forward for the above prices. carriage free. Sole Proprietors : Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited, Llanelly, South Wales. GWILY3I EVANS' QUININE BITIERS. GNVILYSI EVANS' QUININE BITTERS. GWILYII EVANS' QUININE BITTERS.</p>
