        <p>HOWLING HANDICAP AT HAYDOCK.</p>
        <p>A handicap was played on the 'ffaydock green on Saturday afternoon. The weather was all that could be desired. There was a good entry and some of the games were closely con- tested. The first prize, n set of bowls and jack was won by B. Whittle; 2nd, W. redley ; 3rd, J. Strum; 4th, W. Twist.</p>
