        <p>BETTOA PESTH, Tuntisnev. The Criminal Court, yesterday, decided to prosecut6 three Socialistic workmen on a charge of high treason. One man declared that in January last a bomb outrage against the Emporor Francis Joseph had lo,en planu for December. The other two men denied the Charge. THE UNITED STATES AND HAWAII Reuter'. Washington correspondent telegraphs :—Tb. Hawaiian annexation resolution has passed the Senate by 42 votes against 41.</p>
