        <p>PITTS'S GREAT STOCKTAKING SALE. LONDON-ROAD (Continuation of Piccadilly), MANCHESTER. Just past Station, through South Junction Railway Arch PITTS'S STOCKTAKING SALE HAS COM MENCED. This important announcement will doubtless send a thrill of pleasure through the shrewd public who always make a point of patronising Pitts's Sales, knowing full well that at such times a saving of from 25 to 50 per cent may often be effected. Pitts's are renowned far and wide, in fact st md pre-eminent for always giving UTMOST POSSIBLE VALUE, but a: their Stocktaking Sales Pitts's give MORE I THAN VALUE as in many instances articles are marked CONSIDERABLY BELOW COST. in order to clear them out to facilitate Stocktaking. pITTS'S believe that if they sacrifice several hundred pounds during this great Sale, giving their customers the benefit, such sacrifice will pay them in the long run as an advertisement by still further strengthening their well- known reputation as the BEST and CHEAPEST GENERAL FURNISHERS anywhere. It is utterly Impossible for any- one, not having favoured Pitts's with a visit, to conceive the astounding variety and magnitude of Pitts's UNRIVALLED STOCK of new and second-hand FURNITURIC, BEL - STEADS, PIANOS, CYCLES, BASSINETTES, etc.. etc. in fact every household and office requisite, much of which I Pitta's have secured at about a third of their original cost I from numerous large residences, the names of which have already been advertised. This being Pitts's first Summer sale In their new colossal premises in London-road, they intend it to be a veritable "Record Breaker," in the annals of the furnishing trade. PITTS'S will not issue a catalogue, as long before It could be out of the printer's hands many of the choiest lots will have been purchased by wideawake buyers who do not wait to" think about " buying, but buy while the chance is there, but Pitts's will be pleased to send full particulars, to- gether with testimonials and press opinions, on application. Everyone Is invited to inspect whether requiring or not. Courtesy and attention extended to all. Geode purchased and not required immediately will be stored any reasonable time, and insured against fire tree of charge. Cash prices only quoted, but deferred payment may be arranged. As such an opportunity as this of economical furnishing occurs but seldom it is the BOUNDEN DUTY of everyone desirous of laying our their hard earned moo ey to the BEST ADVAN- TAGE to call at PITTS'S WITHOUT DELAY,or they may be too late. PITTS'S HOUSE OF FURNITURE at 151,, 22,28,38 k. 50, Tb, ICO, up to ::,00) guineas need no praise, one might as well paint the lily or gild refined gold. During the sale Pitts's will not alter the prices, but instead augment the quantity and quality of the art'clee, so you may take it for granted that eavh House of Furniture is worth DOUBLE THE PRICE ASKED. Inspection will verify this statement. PITTS'S STOCKTAKING CARPET BARGAINS. Largest and best selected Stock of Brussels, Tapestry, Kiderinster, Wilton. Velvet Pile, etc., etc. Linoleum, Floor- cloths, etc. All English manufacture, at exceptionally low prices to clear, Fitted free ot charge by competent men. IDITTS'S STOCKTAKING CYCLES, PIANOS; BASSIN- ETTBS. LAMPS. CHINA. EARTHENWARE, PIC- TURES, ENGRAVINGS. CUTLERY, and OTHER BARGAINS too numerous to mention. Dun's STOCKTAKING OFFICE AND LIBRARY' 1 BARGAINS—For Half a Century the word " Pitts's" and Good Office Furniture have been synonymous. Pitts's have either the same article at a less price than any other firm, or a better Article at the same price. Desks, Tables, Chairs, Stools, Bookcases Secretaires. Copy Presses, safes, stands at prices that entirely obliterate competition, MITTEL PITTS. Established 18d5. LONDON-ROAD (Close to Station), MANCHESTER. Just through South Junction Railway Arch. Ardwick, Longsight, and Belle Vue Cars pass the door.</p>
